    "blurb": "Search, create, delete, and move LDAP entries",
    "overview": "Manage LDAP directory entries from your Camunda processes. Search for entries, create new ones, and delete or move existing ones, for example to automate the synchronization between your directory and Camunda users together with the Identity connector.",
    "rating": null,
    "reviewCount": 0,
    "mobileBundleId": null,
    "mobileAppStoreId": null
  },
  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Manage your LDAP directory from your processes",
    "splashDescription": "The LDAP connector lets your Camunda processes work directly with your LDAP directory. As steps in your process, you can search for entries, create new entries, delete entries, and move entries to a different place in the directory. This connector is perfect for automating the synchronization between your directory and Camunda users, together with the Identity connector.",
